    "detailed_description": "Put the pedal to the metal in AudioRace, a heart-pounding racing game designed with accessibility at its core, tailored for visually impaired players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel the Race Like Never Before</h2>Navigate tracks using immersive audio cues, guiding you to every curve, straightaway, and victory line.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Ride</h2>From sleek sports cars to powerful muscle machines, find the perfect engine roar to match your style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Across Diverse Tracks</h2>Hear the twists and turns of dynamic environments and push your skills to the limit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat the Best Times</h2>Challenge yourself to shatter records and become the ultimate audio racing champion!<br><br>Whether you're a speed enthusiast or a gamer seeking an inclusive thrill, AudioRace offers adrenaline-pumping action where sound leads the way. Ready to race? \ud83c\udfb6",
